        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.poster.avif?t=1772457189\" width=578 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.webm?t=1772457189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=＾● ⋏ ●＾=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Sweet Whiskers: Cozy Kitty Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime café run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍰 Core Gameplay<br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying bubble merge mechanic — drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😺 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant café managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 9 different girls, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Sweet Whiskers: Cozy Kitty Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.poster.avif?t=1772457189\" width=578 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.webm?t=1772457189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=＾● ⋏ ●＾=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Sweet Whiskers: Cozy Kitty Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime café run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍰 Core Gameplay<br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying bubble merge mechanic — drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😺 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant café managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 9 different girls, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Sweet Whiskers: Cozy Kitty Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
